      "missing_expression": "Minor drift: the two-stage projectile->beam transformation (bolts that BECOME chaining beams mid-flight) has no single 26-geometry member that carries both the fan-out AND the beam-chain, so fork (stage 1, dominant) + a GEOMETRY_PROPAGATION door (stage 2) approximate it -- the source player loses the visual of fragments morphing into forking beams as one continuous emission.",
